		{
			dependencies: ["23BD29330147D352"]
			description: [
				"Small Ships gives exploration boats real cargo and character. Begin with a cog, then build a larger sailing ship when the group can afford it."
				"Small Ships are mobile expedition infrastructure rather than disposable boats. Learn boarding, cargo, sail, and recovery controls near home, then stock the vessel with beds, food, leads, spare boats, and a marked harbour."
				"If the expected result does not appear, preserve the failed setup and compare its recipe, tooltip, environment, orientation, required interaction, keybind, and available space with one known-good example. Change one variable at a time until the cause is proven."
