		{
			dependencies: ["23BD29330147D352"]
			description: [
				"Immersive Aircraft begins with slow, readable flying machines. An Airship is ideal for sightseeing; watch fuel and landing space."
				"Immersive Aircraft vehicles differ in speed, handling, fuel, cargo, and landing needs. Train over familiar ground, establish named landing fields, and avoid maximum-speed flight into terrain the server is still generating."
				"A creative expedition should return with more than screenshots: develop an album, label an object, write the route, and explain one mechanic. Art becomes field knowledge when it helps the next player understand the place."
				"Before marking this lesson complete, identify every named block, item, creature, or interface in JEI and Jade. Inspect both recipes and uses, then perform one small manual test so the objective represents understood behaviour rather than a lucky craft."
			]
